# Rituály listing

`/svatebni-ritualy` uses `Sections/ritualy.twig`.

## Layout

- Soft white→greige intro: eyebrow, title, lead, blurb, CTA → kontakt (“Napsat o rituálu”)
- One wedding per full-width greige band (`.75rem` white gaps) — **not** a card grid, **not** a left-hugging split
- Each band: **names + perex centered on top**, portrait collage centered below
- Collage: lead + optional small aside via `Post::getPreferredImages("portrait", 2)`; native aspect ratios
- Alternate slight left/right sway (`--a` / `--b`); first panel slightly larger
- Title = newlywed names; summary = crafted perex; quiet year; “Prohlédnout”
- No scroll / entrance animations
